1	
speaker	"STUDENT 1"
line	"So eleven is ten plus one?"
2	
speaker	"TEACHER · ENGLISH"
line	"Exactly. Mười một. Twelve is mười hai. Continue the same pattern through fourteen."
3	
speaker	"STUDENT 2"
line	"But fifteen is mười lăm, not mười năm?"
4	
speaker	"TEACHER · ENGLISH"
line	"Correct. In this number pattern, năm changes to lăm. Twenty is hai mươi."
